                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This downvote is a warning to WMR headset owners that this game will accurately detect your WMR headset, but will prevent the game from playing because it's not a Vive or Rift. This is the first Steam game I've come across that specifically blocks play on a WMR headset, so I was a little surprised. Every other game I've played that does not support WMR still works fine, so I find it odd that the developer has made this decision. Unfortunately, I purchased this game while I was on holiday, since I got an alert that it was on sale, so I didn't get a chance to try it before the 14 day refund limit. And of course, Valve won't let me just gift the game to any of my friends with a Vive or Rift. Just wanted to warn any prospective buyers: if you own a WMR headset, don't bother.",
